---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const repo = 'https://github.com/natanatan/Emergent-Epistemic-Ledger';
---
<Base title="About" description="Who is behind the Emergent Epistemic Ledger and how to take part.">
  <p class="kicker">About</p>
  <h1>About EEL</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    EEL grew out of <a href="https://emergentexistence.com">Emergent Existence</a>, a book series on how
    stable structure arises from simpler relations. The ledger applies the same idea to knowledge itself:
    variation, testing, selection, retention and revision, recorded in the open.
  </p>

  <h2>What EEL is not</h2>
  <p>
    It is not a cryptocurrency, and the repository contains no tokens, wallets, payments or staking.
    It does not vote on what is true. Any future market for research work would be a separate project
    built on top of the ledger's public record.
  </p>

  <h2>Take part</h2>
  <p>
    The project is at an early stage and welcomes criticism as much as contributions. Open an
    <a href={`${repo}/issues`}>issue on GitHub</a> to ask a question, report a problem or propose a change,
    and read <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md`}>CONTRIBUTING.md</a> before sending code.
  </p>
</Base>
